+
+// delayPropertyValue() above reports the MEAN, which drops sigma entirely
+// under POCV. For slack the right single number is the pessimistic tail,
+// mean - q*sigma (EarlyLate::early()), matching ReportPath::reportSlack and
+// report_checks. Kept separate rather than changing delayPropertyValue,
+// because arrival/required properties need different tails.
+PropertyValue
+Properties::slackPropertyValue(Delay slack)
+{
+  return PropertyValue(delayAsFloat(slack, EarlyLate::early(), sta_),
+                       sta_->units()->timeUnit());
